# Issue 707: AIO Tiered Talent Trainers

**Status**: Design
**Phase**: 1
**Related**: 706 (knight-custom-class), 705 (custom-class-selection-npc), 503 (dynamic-trainer-spawning)  <!-- renumbered from legacy 159/155/157 per MIGRATION_MAP.md, 2026-09-23 -->

---

## Overview

Custom classes learn talents that normally require high levels (40+). Currently these
are force-learned via AIO on login. This issue proposes a more elegant solution:
custom trainers that teach talent ranks progressively as the player levels.

---

## Current Behavior

- Talents are in the custom class spell list with a level requirement
- High-level talents (Sacred Shield, Art of War, etc.) require level 40-80 normally
- These are learned via AIO addon on login, bypassing normal trainer requirements
- Player gets max rank immediately when they hit the level requirement

## Intended Behavior

- Custom trainers spawn for custom class players (existing issue 157)
- Trainer displays a custom AIO gossip menu
- Menu shows talent ranks available at current level
- Player learns ranks progressively: R1 at level 6, R2 at level 9, etc.
- Higher ranks replace lower ranks automatically

---

## Design

### Tiered Talent Progression

Example: Warrior Deflection (5 ranks, +1% parry each)

| Rank | Spell ID | Player Level | Effect |
|------|----------|--------------|--------|
| R1   | 16462    | 6            | +1% parry |
| R2   | 16463    | 9            | +2% parry |
| R3   | 16464    | 12           | +3% parry |
| R4   | 16465    | 15           | +4% parry |
| R5   | 16466    | 18           | +5% parry |

Instead of getting R5 at level 8 immediately, player earns ranks over time.

