### AIO Trainer Gossip Flow

```
1. Player interacts with custom trainer NPC
2. AIO intercepts gossip event
3. Server checks player's custom class and level
4. Server builds list of:
   - Talents with learnable ranks (current level >= rank level)
   - Already-known ranks (grayed out or hidden)
   - Next available rank for each talent
5. AIO sends custom frame to client showing:
   - Talent name and icon
   - Current rank / max rank
   - "Learn Rank X" button if upgrade available
   - Cost (gold, or free)
6. Player clicks to learn
7. Server teaches spell, removes old rank if applicable
8. Frame updates to show new state
```

### Server-Side Lua

```lua
-- {{{ getAvailableTalentRank
-- Returns the highest rank the player can learn for a tiered talent
function CustomTrainer.getAvailableTalentRank(player, talentData)
    local playerLevel = player:GetLevel()
    local availableRank = nil

    for i, rankData in ipairs(talentData.ranks) do
        if playerLevel >= rankData.level then
            -- Check if player already knows this or higher rank
            if not player:HasSpell(rankData.spell) then
                -- Check if player knows a lower rank
                local hasLowerRank = false
                for j = 1, i - 1 do
                    if player:HasSpell(talentData.ranks[j].spell) then
                        hasLowerRank = true
                        break
                    end
                end

                if hasLowerRank or i == 1 then
                    availableRank = rankData
                end
            end
        end
    end

    return availableRank
end -- }}}

-- {{{ learnTalentRank
-- Teaches a talent rank, removing previous rank if exists
function CustomTrainer.learnTalentRank(player, talentData, rankIndex)
    local rankData = talentData.ranks[rankIndex]

    -- Remove previous ranks
    for i = 1, rankIndex - 1 do
        local oldSpell = talentData.ranks[i].spell
        if player:HasSpell(oldSpell) then
            player:RemoveSpell(oldSpell, false, false)
        end
    end

    -- Learn new rank
    player:LearnSpell(rankData.spell)

    return true
end -- }}}
```

### Client-Side AIO Frame

```lua
